<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BACKSTAGE / RECOVERY</p><h1>Protect the work.<br><em>Keep control.</em></h1><p class="lead">Encrypted application data and media snapshots. Recovery keys stay separate from the downloadable archive.</p></div></div>
