<section class="panel"><h2>Create a snapshot</h2><p>Includes application database records, private configuration and uploaded media. Website code comes from its matching installation package. Requests pause briefly while maintenance holds the site lock.</p><form method="post" class="form-stack"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="create"><label class="field-stack">Current owner password<input type="password" name="owner_password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="72"></label><button class="button" type="submit">Create encrypted snapshot</button></form><p class="small muted">Browser operations have a safe time budget and a 512 MB archive limit. Failure does not publish a completed snapshot or commit a partial database restore. Larger installations still need hosting-panel backups.</p></section>
